 'LinguaMate uses a lightweight RAG knowledge base. RetrievalService searches knowledge_chunk by content and keywords, then AgentOrchestrator adds the retrieved snippets to the agent trace and injects them into the model prompt. The seed knowledge base includes writing rubrics, common grammar errors, RAG workflow notes, and tool descriptions.',
 CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('LinguaMate Agent Tool Map', 'architecture', 'agent,tool,dictionary,news,writing,conversation,工具',
 'LinguaMate tools include DictionaryTool for word lookup, NewsRecommendTool for reading recommendations, EssayScoringTool for writing review, RetrievalService for RAG knowledge search, and OpenAiCompatibleClient for model API calls. The agent loop is Observe, Think, Act, and Answer.',
 CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);




